==Description==
The '''MeltingIceCream Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 26 of the premium [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{BeachBalls|860}} or {{Robux|65}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{BeachBalls|10,670}} or {{Robux|2,015}}. This item also has had two other costs. First one was the cost before its 20% discount, which had a cost of {{Robux|82}} with a total cost of {{Robux|2,532}}. The second was the price prior to the [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]] individual skip cost fix, where it had a a total cost of {{Robux|1,982}}.

The '''MeltingIceCream Nametag''' has light green text with a green outline. On top of the text, there is a giant cone which has green ice cream leaking out of it.

