==Trivia==
*'''MeltingIceCream Nametag''' is a summer variant of the [[MeltingIce Nametag]].
**Due to the nametag title getting cut off in the update log, the name of the nametag would appear as just "''MeltingIce''". This would make it seem like the [[MeltingIce Nametag]] was accidentally re-added to another pass again on first glance.

